From: w1700k lan2 investigation
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: airoha: add a post-config hook for PCS lanes

Some lanes need additional register writes after the generic PCS config
sequence has completed. Add an optional match-data callback and invoke it
at the end of airoha_pcs_config().

The callback is wired up only for the AN7581 Ethernet PCS in the following
JCPLL fix; other lanes keep the existing configuration path.

---
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
@@ -948,6 +948,9 @@
 				AIROHA_PCS_XFI_TX_FC_EN | AIROHA_PCS_XFI_RX_FC_EN :
 				0);
 
+	if (data->post_config)
+		data->post_config(priv, index, interface);
+
 	return 0;
 }
 
@@ -1641,3 +1644,4 @@
 	.link_up = an7581_pcs_phya_link_up,
 	.rxlock_workaround = an7581_pcs_rxlock_workaround,
+	.post_config = an7581_pcs_jcpll_recal,
 };
